return ['domain'=>'zinn-order-updates','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-order-updates','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-08T13:09:49+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-08T13:09:49+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Order Updates'=>'Zinn® Order Updates','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates','SMS and WhatsApp order updates for your store, sent through Zinn® Campaigns under your store\'s own name. Connect in one click; no keys to paste.'=>'Wararka dalabka ee SMS iyo WhatsApp ee dukaankaaga, oo lagu soo diro Zinn® Campaigns iyadoo la adeegsanayo magaca dukaankaaga. Ku xir hal gujin; ma jiraan furayaal la dhejinayo.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Order Updates'=>'Cusboonaysiinta Dalabka','Your store is connected to Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Dukaankaagu wuxuu ku xidhan yahay Zinn® Campaigns.','Your store is disconnected. No messages will be sent.'=>'Dukaankaaga waa la jaray. Ma jiro farriimo la diri doono.','That connection took too long or was started in another browser. Press Connect again.'=>'Xiriirkaasi wuxuu qaatay waqti aad u dheer ama waxaa laga bilaabay biraawsar kale. Mar kale taabo Ku xir.','Zinn® did not accept the connection. Press Connect again; if it keeps failing, contact Zinn® support.'=>'Zinn® ma aqbalin xiriirka. Mar kale taabo "Ku xir"; haddii ay sii socoto guul-darradu, la xiriir taageerada Zinn®.','Your site could not reach Zinn®. Check that your host allows outgoing connections, then press Connect again.'=>'Boggaagu ma gaari karin Zinn®. Hubi in martigeliyahaagu oggol yahay xiriirrada baxaya, ka dibna mar kale taabo «Ku xir».','Send your customers SMS and WhatsApp updates about their orders, under your store\'s own name, paid from your Zinn® credit.'=>'U dir macaamiishaada wararka ku saabsan dalabyadooda adigoo isticmaalaya SMS iyo WhatsApp, oo wata magaca dukaankaaga, lagana bixiyay dhibcahaaga Zinn®.','Connect opens Zinn® in this window. Sign in or create an account, approve this store, and you come straight back here. You never paste a key.'=>'Ku xidh waxay ku furaysaa Zinn® daaqadan. Soo gal ama samayso koonto, ansixi dukaankan, waxaadna si toos ah ugu soo noqonaysaa halkan. Waligaa furaha ma dhejisanaysid.','Connect to Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Ku xir Zinn® Campaigns','Connected, but Zinn® could not be reached just now. We will try again shortly.'=>'Waa ku xidhan yahay, laakiin Zinn® lama xidhiidhi karin hadda. Wax yar ka dib ayaannu mar kale isku dayi doonnaa.','Store'=>'Dukaan','Connected'=>'Ku xiran','Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Zinn® Campaigns','Open for your account'=>'U furan koontadaada','Not open for your account yet. Zinn® will e-mail you when it is.'=>'Weli uma furna koontadaada. Zinn® ayaa iimayl kuu soo diri doona marka ay diyaar noqoto.','Disconnect'=>'Kala fur','You are not allowed to connect this store.'=>'Loma oggola inaad ku xirto dukaankan.','You are not allowed to disconnect this store.'=>'Lamaad ogolaan inaad ka goyso dukaankan.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hagayaal iyo adeegyo','User guides'=>'Hagayaasha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhri hagaha isticmaalaha %s','Hide this'=>'Qari tan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Martigelinta Zinn® ee WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kaydinta maalinlaha ah, wareejinta bilaashka ah iyo qaybta koontaroolka oo loo dhisay dadka maamula wax ka badan hal goob.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibso oo iibi mareegaha dhisan, magacyada domain-ka iyo meelaynta xiriiriyaha, iyadoo lacagta si ammaan ah loo hayo ilaa labada dhinacba ay ku qancaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — shaqaalayso dad shaqadoodu tahay arrintan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqa xorta ah ee adduunka oo dhan: baadh in ka badan 10,000 oo adeegyo diyaarsan oo ka socda qorayaasha, naqshadeeyayaasha, horumariyayaasha iyo khubarada SEO, ama dheji mashruuc oo u oggolow inay dalab soo gudbiyaan.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Fiiri qoraallada soo-deynta ee Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Adeegga cusboonaysiinta ee Zinn® ma bixinin xiriirinta soo dejinta ee cusboonaysiintan. Hubi in boggani gaari karo madasha Zinn®, ka dibna isku day mar kale.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Cusboonaysiinta lagama soo dejisan karin adeegga cusboonaysiinta Zinn® (%s). Fadlan isku day mar kale dhowr daqiiqo ka dib.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusbooneysiinta la soo dejiyay kuma guulaysan hubinta sax ahaanshaha loomana rakibin.']];